name: undeclared_work
description: "Work while claiming - everyone on an employer's payroll while on Jobseeker benefit, and their Jobseeker claims (via on employed_by = jobseeker_months and over_limit_months above the 200-a-month permitted earnings). Most earned under the limit or started work in the month their claim closed. Two employers pay 20 claimants full wages for 6 months or more."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: benefits_screen_links_dataset
    sourceCol: src
    targetCol: dst
    linkKindCol: kind
    attrCols[4]: ts,amount,via,screen
  filter:
    kind: group
    op: AND
    items[1]{kind,field,operator,value}:
      condition,screen,"=","work_while_claiming"
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    hulls: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
